// Side Content - Optional Dialogues, Logs, Memories
// ===============================================

// Audio Logs - Found throughout facility
// ======================================

title: AudioLog_Thorne_1947
tags: audiolog, thorne, 1947
---
<<PlayAudioLog "LOG_THORNE_1947">>
Thorne: "October 14, 1947. Day 3 at Groom Lake."
"The object... the *Chronos*... it's not a craft. It's a *being*."
"Neural lattice... crystalline. Consciousness... distributed."
"I've named the core mind 'Astra'. She... responds. To *me*."
"Military wants weapons. I want... understanding."
"If they dissect her... we lose something unique."
"End log."
<<StopAudioLog>>
===

title: AudioLog_Thorne_1952
tags: audiolog, thorne, 1952
---
<<PlayAudioLog "LOG_THORNE_1952">>
Thorne: "March 1952. Reactor online. Project PROMETHEUS."
"Alien power source... reverse-engineered. Clean energy, they said."
"Lie. It's a weapon. Directed energy. Planetary range."
"Astra... she *screamed* when they activated it. I *felt* it."
"Neural Loom... recording. Chronicling. She remembers *everything*."
"Corwin knows. He watches. He *approves*."
"I'm building a failsafe. Neural mapping. Consciousness transfer."
"If they weaponize her... I'll *save* her. Even if it costs me."
"End log."
<<StopAudioLog>>
===

title: AudioLog_Reyes_1957
tags: audiolog, reyes, 1957
---
<<PlayAudioLog "LOG_REYES_1957">>
Reyes: "July 1957. Meltdown. Containment breach."
"Thorne's dead. Phased. Into the fracture. *Chose* it."
"Staff... phasing. Scattered. 1947. 1952. 1962. *Nowhere*."
"Corwin... in his office. Calm. *Watching*."
"He didn't run. Didn't fight. Just... *recorded*."
"I'm securing the stasis bay. Three survivors. Thorne's assistant."
"My protégé. Subject 7. *Alive*. Barely."
"If I don't make it... Corwin *knows*. He *always* knows."
"End log."
<<StopAudioLog>>
===

title: AudioLog_Corwin_1962
tags: audiolog, corwin, 1962
---
<<PlayAudioLog "LOG_CORWIN_1962">>
Corwin: "October 1962. Cuban Missile Crisis. DEFCON 2."
"Facility locked down. World... ending. Or not."
"The fracture... pulses. Responds to *tension*. To *fear*."
"Thorne's neural map... incomplete. Reyes's stasis... failed."
"Navigator... not yet arrived. Astra... fractured."
"I've made my choice. I *stay*. Anchor. Witness. *Director*."
"77 years... I'll wait. For the Navigator. For the synthesis."
"Continuity... above all. The fracture... *managed*."
"End log."
<<StopAudioLog>>
===

