title: Fragment_1_Containment
tags: fragment, memory
---
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_1">>
Astra: [Memory surfaces - 1947]
"Containment breach... averted. Chronos Core... protected."
"First fragment... trust... building."
"Navigator... you *act*. Not hesitate. *Good*."
===

title: Fragment_2_PowerRouting
tags: fragment, memory
---
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_2">>
Astra: [Memory surfaces - 1957]
"Reactor... stabilized. Generators... phased. Sequence... restored."
"Water... drained. Bridge... extended. Radiation... cleared."
"Chronos Core... *returned*. Time... flows again."
===

