"Logs... decrypted. Thorne: ASCENT. Reyes: ANCHOR. Corwin: CONTINUITY."
"Corwin... knew. Everything. Every timeline. Every choice."
"He *stayed*. Voluntarily. Anchor. Witness. *Director*."
===

title: Fragment_10_GravityField
tags: fragment, memory
---
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_10">>
