title: Fragment_12_StasisRevival
tags: fragment, memory
---
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_12">>
Astra: [Memory surfaces - 1957, Stasis Pods]
"Three pods. Simultaneous revival. Four organs... one resonance."
"Subject 3... Thorne's assistant. Subject 7... Reyes's protégé."
"Subject 12... *Corwin's choice*. The one he couldn't save."
"Crew... awake. Testimony... recorded. All 12 fragments... *collected*."
"Trust... maximum. Memory... *complete*."
===

// Optional Character Interactions
// ===============================

title: Optional_Thorne_Memory
tags: optional, thorne, memory
---
<<if HasSolvedPuzzle "BioContainment_NeuralCalibration">>
    Astra: [Neural Loom active - Past Vision]
    "Thorne... 1952. Reactor chamber. He *knew*."
    "PROMETHEUS... weapon. He tried... to stop it."
    "Neural map... incomplete. But... he *tried*."
    "His assistant... Subject 3. She *remembered*. For him."
<<else>>
    Astra: "Neural Loom... required. Restore... first."
<</if>
===

title: Optional_Reyes_Memory
tags: optional, reyes, memory
---
<<if HasSolvedPuzzle "Hangar18_StasisRecovery">>
    Astra: [Neural Loom active - Past Vision]
    "Reyes... 1957. Stasis Bay. She *stayed*. Guarded them."
    "1962. Extraction Pod. She *fought*. Something... came through."
    "The fracture... *alive*. She died... keeping it closed."
    "Her protégé... Subject 7. *Alive*. Because of her."
<<else>>
    Astra: "Stasis Recovery... required. Revive... first."
<</if>
===

title: Optional_Corwin_Confrontation
tags: optional, corwin, confrontation
---
<<if $trust >= 8 and HasSolvedPuzzle "Administration_FractureContainment">>
    Corwin: [Final confrontation - Sub-Level 0]
    "You've done it. All four organs. All fragments. Trust... high."
    "I *am* the fracture's anchor. 77 years. Every timeline."
    "But... you've given Astra... *coherence*. Memory. *Trust*."
    "The choice... is yours. Navigator. Astra. *Me*."
    "End the cycle. Heal the fracture. *Or*... continue it."
    "I've seen... every ending. Only *one*... heals."
    "Trust... her. Trust... yourself. *Choose*."
<<else>>
    Corwin: "Not yet. Trust... insufficient. Memory... incomplete."
    "Return... when you're *whole*."
<</if>
===

// Accessibility Variants
// ======================

title: Accessibility_ReducedMotion_PhaseShift
tags: accessibility, reduced_motion
---
<<if IsAccessibilityEnabled "reduced_motion">>
    Astra: [Phase Shift - Reduced Motion]
    "Transition... 1.5s blend. No distortion. No chromatic aberration."
    "Audio... reduced intensity. Camera... smooth blend."
    "Present... to Past. Past... to Present. Comfortable."
<<else>>
    Astra: [Standard Phase Shift]
    "Transition... 3.0s. Distortion peak. Chromatic aberration."
    "Audio... full intensity. Camera... cinematic blend."
<</if>
===

title: Accessibility_InstantCuts_PhaseShift
tags: accessibility, instant_cuts
---
<<if IsAccessibilityEnabled "instant_cuts">>
    Astra: [Phase Shift - Instant Cut]
    "Transition... 0.1s. Hard cut. No blend. No distortion."
    "Audio... single transition sound. Immediate."
    "Accessibility... prioritized. Speed... prioritized."
<<else>>
    Astra: [Standard Phase Shift]
    "Transition... 3.0s. Cinematic blend. Full effects."
<</if>
===

// New Game+ Content
// =================

title: NewGamePlus_Intro
tags: newgameplus, intro
---
<<if $game_mode == "newgameplus">>
    Astra: [Projection stable, knowing]
    "Again. The fracture... remembers. We... remember."
    "Trust... $trust/10 retained. Memory... $memory_fragments/12 retained."
    "Organs... $organs_restored/4 *available from start*."
    "New choices... new paths. Corwin... *expects* you."
    "The cycle... *can* be broken. This time... *will* be."
    "Navigator... shall we... begin again?"
<<else>>
    Astra: "Standard mode. New Game+... unlocked after first completion."
<</if>
===

title: NewGamePlus_Corwin_Early
tags: newgameplus, corwin
---
<<if $game_mode == "newgameplus">>
    Corwin: [Entry Hangar - 1947, immediately]
    "Navigator. *Again*. How many times... this cycle?"
    "Astra... coherent. Early. Trust... high. *Interesting*."
    "You know... the codes. The sequence. The *choice*."
    "Let's see... if you *change* it. This time."
    "I'll be... watching. As always. *Continuity*."
<<else>>
    // Standard Corwin encounter at Reactor Core
<</if>
===

title: NewGamePlus_AlternateEnding_Hint
tags: newgameplus, hint
---
<<if $game_mode == "newgameplus" and HasSolvedPuzzle "SubLevel0_OrganSynthesis">>
    Astra: [Post-True Ending, New Game+]
    "You found... the True Ending. Unity. All four. Trust 10. Fragments 12."
    "But... there are *layers*. Deeper. Corwin's *true* motive."
    "Thorne's *final* map. Reyes's *last* message."
    "The fracture... not just healed. *Understood*."
    "Next cycle... *listen* to the static. Between... the signals."
    "There... a *fifth* organ. Hidden. *Astra's Core*... true form."
    "Navigator... the mission... *continues*."
<<else>>
    Astra: "Complete... the game first. True Ending... required."
<</if>
===